      "Title": "Geography",
      "GraphCollections": [
        {
          "Title": "",
          "Copy": "Each month, about 50 million people visit Stack Overflow to learn, share, and build their careers. Industry estimates suggest that 20-25 million of these people are professional developers and university-level students. The vast majority of our survey respondents this year said they are professional developers or who code sometimes as part of their work or students preparing for such a career.\n\nSee our [Methodology section](#methodology) for details on how developers around the world accessed our survey.",
